msgid "A Facebook group auto poster helps you share a prepared post across the groups you select. Postika combines a post editor, group selection, scheduling, and posting logs in one desktop app."
msgstr "Bango otomatiki la kikundi cha Facebook hukusaidia kushiriki chapisho lililotayarishwa kwenye vikundi unavyochagua. Postika inachanganya kihariri cha chapisho, uteuzi wa kikundi, kuratibu na kuchapisha kumbukumbu katika programu moja ya eneo-kazi."

msgid "A few things to know"
msgstr "Mambo machache ya kujua"

msgid "A little less busywork. A little more time."
msgstr "Kazi kidogo kidogo. Muda kidogo zaidi."

msgid "A supported Windows, macOS, or Linux computer, an installed Chrome or Chromium browser, and your Facebook account. Platform downloads are listed on the downloads page."
msgstr "Kompyuta inayotumika ya Windows, macOS, au Linux, kivinjari cha Chrome au Chromium kilichosakinishwa, na akaunti yako ya Facebook. Vipakuliwa vya jukwaa vimeorodheshwa kwenye ukurasa wa vipakuliwa."

msgid "Already have a post worth sharing? Import posts from a Facebook page your signed-in account can access. Review the text and images, make your edits, and add the posts you want to your queue."
msgstr "Je, tayari una chapisho linalostahili kushirikiwa? Ingiza machapisho kutoka kwa ukurasa wa Facebook akaunti yako uliyoingia inaweza kufikia. Kagua maandishi na picha, fanya mabadiliko yako, na uongeze machapisho unayotaka kwenye foleni yako."

msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "Kabla ya kuanza"

msgid "Bring your page posts along."
msgstr "Lete machapisho ya ukurasa wako."

msgid "Browser language"
msgstr "Lugha ya kivinjari"

msgid "Bulk Poster"
msgstr "Bango Wingi"

msgid "Can multiple Facebook accounts post at the same time?"
msgstr "Akaunti nyingi za Facebook zinaweza kuchapisha kwa wakati mmoja?"

msgid "Check your connection and try again."
msgstr "Angalia muunganisho wako na ujaribu tena."

msgid "Choose a version for your computer. Requires Chrome or Chromium."
msgstr "Chagua toleo la kompyuta yako. Inahitaji Chrome au Chromium."

msgid "Choose from 33 interface languages, including right-to-left layouts. Menus, controls, and app-generated log messages follow your choice across windows. And with 189 themes, you can make Postika feel like your own."
msgstr "Chagua kutoka lugha 33 za kiolesura, ikijumuisha miundo kutoka kulia kwenda kushoto. Menyu, vidhibiti na ujumbe wa kumbukumbu unaozalishwa na programu hufuata chaguo lako katika madirisha yote. Na kwa mandhari 189, unaweza kuifanya Postika ijisikie kama yako."

msgid "Choose your own minimum and maximum interval between posts to avoid posting in rapid succession and help reduce the risk of rate limits or account restrictions. Follow progress as the queue runs, and pause whenever you need to."
msgstr "Chagua muda wako wa chini na wa juu zaidi kati ya machapisho ili kuepuka kuchapisha kwa mfululizo wa haraka na usaidie kupunguza hatari ya vikomo vya viwango au vikwazo vya akaunti. Fuata maendeleo wakati foleni inaendelea, na usimame wakati wowote unapohitaji."

