msgstr "Haikuweza kupakia picha hii ya skrini. Ifunge na ujaribu tena."

msgid "Couldn’t refresh release notes. Please try again."
msgstr "Imeshindwa kuonyesha upya madokezo kuhusu toleo. Tafadhali jaribu tena."

msgid "Does a submission mean my post is published?"
msgstr "Je, uwasilishaji unamaanisha kuwa chapisho langu limechapishwa?"

msgid "Does my computer need to stay on?"
msgstr "Je, kompyuta yangu inahitaji kusalia?"

