msgid "Facebook Group Auto Poster for Desktop | Postika"
msgstr "Chapisha kwa pamoja katika vikundi vya Facebook | Postika"

msgid "Facebook Groups"
msgstr "Vikundi vya Facebook"

msgid "Features"
msgstr "Vipengele"

msgid "Follow progress group by group. See what’s published, what’s awaiting approval, and what needs attention, including failed, skipped, and unconfirmed submissions. Pause, resume, or stop your queue from the same window."
msgstr "Fuata maendeleo ya kikundi baada ya kikundi. Angalia kilichochapishwa, kinachosubiri kuidhinishwa na kinachohitaji kuzingatiwa, ikijumuisha mawasilisho ambayo hayajafaulu, yaliyorukwa na ambayo hayajathibitishwa. Sitisha, endelea, au simamisha foleni yako kutoka kwa dirisha moja."

msgid "Get in touch"
msgstr "Wasiliana"

msgid "Intel Macs (.dmg)"
msgstr "Intel Mac (.dmg)"

msgid "Is Postika a Chrome extension?"
msgstr "Je, Postika ni kiendelezi cha Chrome?"

msgid "Keep Postika open and your computer awake while a queue runs. Queues and posting logs aren’t restored after quitting."
msgstr "Weka Postika wazi na kompyuta yako ikiwa macho wakati foleni inaendelea. Foleni na kumbukumbu za uchapishaji hazirejeshwe baada ya kuacha."

msgid "Keep your device on and awake, with Postika open, so it can handle the posting for you."
msgstr "Washa kifaa chako na kikiwa macho, Postika ikiwa wazi, ili iweze kushughulikia uchapishaji kwa ajili yako."

