msgstr "Mac za mfululizo wa M (.dmg)"

msgid "Main navigation"
msgstr "Urambazaji mkuu"

msgid "Move Postika into Applications before opening it."
msgstr "Hamisha Postika kwenye Programu kabla ya kuifungua."

msgid "No themes found. Try another name."
msgstr "Hakuna mandhari yaliyopatikana. Jaribu jina lingine."

msgid "One good post. All the right groups."
msgstr "Chapisho moja nzuri. Makundi yote sahihi."

msgid "Post to multiple Facebook groups with Postika. A desktop auto poster with scheduling, multiple accounts, 33 interface languages, and clear posting logs."
msgstr "Chapisha kwa vikundi vingi vya Facebook ukitumia Postika. Bango la kiotomatiki la eneo-kazi lenye kuratibu, akaunti nyingi, lugha 33 za kiolesura, na kumbukumbu wazi za uchapishaji."

msgid "Post to multiple Facebook groups without repeating the same steps. Write once, choose your groups, and post now or schedule for later."
msgstr "Chapisha kwa vikundi vingi vya Facebook bila kurudia hatua sawa. Andika mara moja, chagua vikundi vyako, na uchapishe sasa au uratibishe baadaye."

msgid "Postika Facebook page-post import dialog"
msgstr "Kidirisha cha kuingiza ukurasa wa postika kwenye Facebook"

msgid "Postika account selector and separate account workspaces"
msgstr "Kiteuzi cha akaunti ya Postika na nafasi za kazi za akaunti tofauti"

msgid "Postika composer with rich-text controls and image uploads"
msgstr "Mtunzi wa Postika aliye na vidhibiti vya maandishi mengi na upakiaji wa picha"

msgid "Postika features"
msgstr "Vipengele vya Postika"

msgid "Postika home"
msgstr "Postika nyumbani"

msgid "Postika is a desktop app for Windows, macOS, and Linux. It uses an installed Chrome or Chromium browser for your Facebook sessions."
msgstr "Postika ni programu ya eneo-kazi kwa Windows, macOS, na Linux. Inatumia kivinjari cha Chrome au Chromium kilichosakinishwa kwa vipindi vyako vya Facebook."

msgid "Postika language selector and localized interface"
msgstr "Kiteuzi cha lugha cha Postika na kiolesura kilichojanibishwa"

msgid "Postika posting intervals and scheduling controls"
msgstr "Vipindi vya uchapishaji wa Postika na vidhibiti vya kuratibu"

msgid "Postika posting logs with per-group results and queue controls"
msgstr "Postika inachapisha kumbukumbu zenye matokeo ya kila kikundi na vidhibiti vya foleni"

msgid "Postika scheduling controls"
msgstr "Vidhibiti vya kuratibu vya Postika"

msgid "Posting intervals don’t guarantee protection from Facebook restrictions or bans."
msgstr "Vipindi vya uchapishaji havihakikishii ulinzi dhidi ya vikwazo au marufuku ya Facebook."

msgid "Prepare now. Schedule for later."
msgstr "Jitayarishe sasa. Ratiba ya baadaye."

msgid "Questions"
msgstr "Maswali"

msgid "Refresh release notes"
msgstr "Onyesha upya madokezo ya kutolewa"

msgid "Release notes"
msgstr "Toa maelezo"

msgid "Release notes are up to date."
msgstr "Maelezo kuhusu matoleo yamesasishwa."

msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "Ripoti tatizo"

msgid "Run posting queues for multiple Facebook accounts at the same time. Each account keeps its own browser session, groups, drafts, and posting settings, so you can prepare another post or check progress without interrupting the other accounts."
msgstr "Endesha foleni za uchapishaji kwa akaunti nyingi za Facebook kwa wakati mmoja. Kila akaunti huweka kipindi chake cha kivinjari, vikundi, rasimu na mipangilio ya uchapishaji, ili uweze kuandaa chapisho lingine au kuangalia maendeleo bila kukatiza akaunti zingine."

msgid "Schedule your posts for a date and time that suits you. When that time arrives, Postika automatically starts posting to your selected groups. You don’t need to be there to press Post."
msgstr "Panga machapisho yako kwa tarehe na wakati unaokufaa. Wakati huo ukifika, Postika itaanza kutuma kiotomatiki kwa vikundi ulivyochagua. Huhitaji kuwa hapo ili kubonyeza Chapisha."

msgid "Screenshot preview"
msgstr "Onyesho la kukagua picha ya skrini"

msgid "Search by name…"
msgstr "Tafuta kwa jina..."

msgid "Search themes"
msgstr "Tafuta mandhari"

msgid "See where every post stands."
msgstr "Angalia ambapo kila chapisho limesimama."

msgid "Selected"
msgstr "Imechaguliwa"

msgid "Set your pace. Leave room between posts."
msgstr "Weka kasi yako. Acha nafasi kati ya machapisho."

msgid "Several accounts. Posting at the same time."
msgstr "Akaunti kadhaa. Kuchapisha kwa wakati mmoja."

msgid "Skip opening every group and pasting the same thing again. Write your post with rich text, add and reorder your images, then search and select the Facebook groups you want to share with. Your draft stays saved while you get it right."
msgstr "Ruka kufungua kila kikundi na kubandika kitu kile kile tena. Andika chapisho lako kwa maandishi tele, ongeza na upange upya picha zako, kisha utafute na uchague vikundi vya Facebook unavyotaka kushiriki navyo. Rasimu yako itasalia kuhifadhiwa huku ukiipata sawa."

msgid "Skip to content"
msgstr "Ruka hadi yaliyomo"

msgid "Some groups require approval. Posting logs distinguish published posts, pending approval, failed, skipped, and unconfirmed submissions. Check unconfirmed results on Facebook before retrying."
msgstr "Baadhi ya vikundi vinahitaji idhini. Kumbukumbu za kuchapisha hutofautisha machapisho yaliyochapishwa, idhini inayosubiri, mawasilisho ambayo hayajafaulu, yamerukwa na ambayo hayajathibitishwa. Angalia matokeo ambayo hayajathibitishwa kwenye Facebook kabla ya kujaribu tena."

msgid "System default"
msgstr "Chaguomsingi ya mfumo"

msgid "System default ({0})"
msgstr "Chaguomsingi ya mfumo ({0})"

msgid "System packages may ask for administrator authorization."
msgstr "Vifurushi vya mfumo vinaweza kuomba idhini ya msimamizi."

msgid "Unsigned installer: Windows may show a SmartScreen warning. The portable version needs no installation; account data stays in the app data folder."
msgstr "Kisakinishi ambacho hakijasainiwa: Windows inaweza kuonyesha onyo la SmartScreen. Toleo la portable halihitaji usakinishaji; data ya akaunti inasalia kwenye folda ya data ya programu."

