msgid "Yes. Keep Postika open and your computer awake while a queue is scheduled or running. Queues and posting logs are not restored after quitting."
msgstr "Ndiyo. Weka Postika wazi na kompyuta yako ikiwa macho wakati foleni imeratibiwa au kuendeshwa. Foleni na kumbukumbu za kuchapisha hazirejeshwa baada ya kuacha."

msgid "Yes. Multiple accounts can run their posting queues in parallel. Each account has a separate browser session, groups, drafts, and posting settings. Switching accounts doesn’t interrupt the other queues."
msgstr "Ndiyo. Akaunti nyingi zinaweza kuendesha foleni zao za uchapishaji kwa sambamba. Kila akaunti ina kipindi tofauti cha kivinjari, vikundi, rasimu na mipangilio ya uchapishaji. Kubadilisha akaunti hakukatizi foleni zingine."

